        "description": {
          "text": "Added new indication in combination with enfotumab vedotin as neoadjuvant then adjuvant treatment for adults with muscle invasive bladder cancer ineligible for cisplatin-containing chemotherapy",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics license application provides for a new indication for Keytruda Qlex, in combination with enfotumab vedotin, as neoadjuvant treatment, and then continued after cystectomy as adjuvant treatment for the treatment of adult patients with muscle invasive bladder cancer who are ineligible for cisplatin-containing chemotherapy.",
              "doc_id": "1e34fcc2-f352-5242-a3ff-b32b3e5e5317",
