        "description": {
          "text": "Added a Patient Experience section (14.2) with patient-reported preference results for subcutaneous coformulation over IV pembrolizumab",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sBLA provides for the addition of a Patient Experience section (14.2) of the U.S. Prescribing Information labeling, to incorporate patient-reported preference results from Study MK-3475A-F11, entitled \u201cA Phase 2 Study to Evaluate Patient Reported Preference for Subcutaneous Pembrolizumab Coformulated with Hyaluronidase (MK-3475A) Over Intravenous Pembrolizumab Formulation in Participants with Multiple Tumor Types.\u201d",
